<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.16.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.16.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.16.0 (2026-11-24): Chapter 11 page story done. Page 9.21.0 lists the 19 codes of the deck in slide order and runs each in the page with its hidden set-up; the shown code equals the deck code."""@en .

ex:TK11_Page_11_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Page 03-materials/ch11/page/sen0414_ch11_page_v9_21_0.html built from template 9.53.6 (new file: runs an example's hidden setup lines before the shown code), page data 2.29.0 (new file: passes setup through), builder 4.18.3 unchanged, manifest 03-materials/ch11/page/chapter_code_ch11_v1_3_0.json (new file: same code and expected results as 1.2.0 plus setup per example; written by chapter_deck_build_v2_8_0.py with MANIFEST_ONLY=1 from spec_v4_1_0, deck file untouched). Page 9.20.0 stays unchanged." .
ex:TK11_Page_11_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Logs in 08-tooling/ch11-page/logs_v9_21_0: code check C1+C2+C3+C4 on source, deck, manifest and page: 19 examples, 0 findings (the page holds the whole code string of every example, in deck order). Full page test 9.39.0 in a browser: exit 0, 416 features passed, 0 failed; its chapter-code step opened and ran all 19 examples in the page, each showing a visual result with no error. Open point: the page's per-concept examples (concept panels) still come from the old deck transcript examples_out_v3_0_0.json and are not the chapter code; they are outside the Slide code tab and are reported to the Owner." .
ex:ST11_Page_11 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Criterion met for chapter 11: the page shows, explains and runs all 19 codes of the deck, equal to the deck, in one place." .
